The size dependence and cutoff issues for 
linear response calculation have been addressed:

Results for runs with OPLS-AA acetamide (fully flexible)  in TIP4P water.
8M averaging/2M equilibration, 25 C, 1 atm

# Water   RCUT  SCUT  ICUT  RxnFld  ESX-Coul  ESX-LJ   E-Total
  260      8.5   8.5    0     N     -25.6      -3.9    -2654
  260      9.5   9.5    0     N     -29.6      -3.9    -2643
  500      8.5   8.5    0     N     -25.9      -4.0    -5048
  500     10.0  10.0    0     N     -26.4      -4.1    -5071
  500     10.0  12.0    0     N     -25.4      -4.8    -5063
 
  260      8.5   8.5    0     Y     -24.9      -4.0    -2586
  260      9.5   9.5    0     Y     -24.0      -4.4    -2598
  500      8.5   8.5    0     Y     -24.6      -3.2    -4964
  500     10.0  10.0    0     Y     -25.8      -4.1    -4953

